sentences.t:
Los de Alcoçer a mio Çid yal dan parias
e los de Teca e los de Ter[rer] la casa;
a los de Calatauth, sabet, ma’les pesava.

sentences.l:
Those of Alcoçer to my Çid already-to-him give tributes
and those of Teca and those of Ter[rer] the house;
to those of Calatauth, know-ye, ill-to-them it-weighed.

sentences.t:
